{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02732",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 6.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Okay, hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.77,
      "end_seconds": 15.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "So, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.32,
      "end_seconds": 23.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. Right, did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.79,
      "end_seconds": 31.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.89,
      "end_seconds": 36.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Alright, how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 41.32,
      "end_seconds": 45.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Ah, he's been passing kidney stones, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.93,
      "end_seconds": 51.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "So, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.47,
      "end_seconds": 56.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "It's been two days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.18,
      "end_seconds": 60.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "What about being thirsty, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.66,
      "end_seconds": 70.71,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "So, yeah. About a week, I'd say. With being thirsty, about a eight out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.37,
      "end_seconds": 76.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "And what about fractures, weight loss or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.27,
      "end_seconds": 85.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "No, no fractures, weight loss or low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.71,
      "end_seconds": 87.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "How about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.67,
      "end_seconds": 95.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.36,
      "end_seconds": 98.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.83,
      "end_seconds": 101.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.5,
      "end_seconds": 104.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.33,
      "end_seconds": 107.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.0,
      "end_seconds": 111.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.85,
      "end_seconds": 118.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "It's clopidogrel, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.57,
      "end_seconds": 121.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.15,
      "end_seconds": 127.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "75 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.13,
      "end_seconds": 128.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.51,
      "end_seconds": 140.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.73,
      "text": "I, I take omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day. Right, I was on metoprolol before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.05,
      "end_seconds": 144.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.99,
      "end_seconds": 149.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.96,
      "end_seconds": 155.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.98,
      "end_seconds": 159.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.43,
      "end_seconds": 164.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Right, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.13,
      "end_seconds": 170.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.67,
      "end_seconds": 176.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.89,
      "end_seconds": 200.03,
      "duration_seconds": 22.14,
      "text": "Heart disease, for about ten years. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I just want to get back to normal, really. I have acid reflux, for about ten years. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.66,
      "end_seconds": 206.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay, I can see heart disease in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.28,
      "end_seconds": 224.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.91,
      "end_seconds": 230.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "No, um, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.04,
      "end_seconds": 248.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.12,
      "end_seconds": 253.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.69,
      "end_seconds": 259.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.4,
      "end_seconds": 276.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.9,
      "end_seconds": 281.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Okay, stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.68,
      "end_seconds": 295.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Your examination is normal and there is no tenderness over the bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.61,
      "end_seconds": 314.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.21,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid. Vitamin D excess is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.74,
      "end_seconds": 320.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.92,
      "end_seconds": 353.0,
      "duration_seconds": 32.08,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange a calcium and parathyroid hormone test for kidney stones. I'd like to arrange a bone density scan for possible hyperparathyroidism. Drink plenty of water and avoid calcium supplements until the results. We'll catch up after the results. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.72,
      "end_seconds": 356.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.27,
      "end_seconds": 359.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Right, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}